      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if they were basically the \"vital pillars\" like you said, does that mean there weren't really any significant drawbacks to their level of influence? like, was there any valid argument that their power actually hurt the economy or worked against democratic principles at all?",
      "source": "evaluator"
